  "category": "process",
  "question": "How does Adam Grenier recommend evaluating whether to invest effort in an emerging acquisition channel?",
  "expected_points": [
    "Look for established channels that are newly becoming scalable.",
    "Consider established channels that introduce a genuinely new capability.",
    "Brand-new channels rarely justify the hoped-for effort early on."
  ],
  "evidence_quote": "So, it existed for a long time and now we're finally getting to a spot where it feels scalable. The other is existing channels that introduce something brand new.",
